;td&gt;…&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;…&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;…&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;50&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;132.6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;✔ / ✔&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;– / –&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;– / –&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;✘&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;i&gt;logged ball-by-ball on device · synced in ~10 checkpoints (every 3–5 min) · submitted on End&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="420" width="500" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-88" value="&lt;b&gt;Analytics (DAY / WEEK / MONTH)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• seam accuracy = 23 ÷ 30 = &lt;b&gt;76.7 %&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• yorker accuracy = 12 ÷ 18 = &lt;b&gt;66.7 %&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• bouncer accuracy = 5 ÷ 8 = &lt;b&gt;62.5 %&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• no-ball rate = 3 ÷ 50 = &lt;b&gt;6 %&lt;/b&gt; · avg speed 131.8 km/h&lt;br&gt;• week / month = Σnum ÷ Σden over sessions (never an average of percentages)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="700" width="500" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-89" value="base" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dom-46" target="dom-82"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-90" value="applied on top" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dom-77" target="dom-82"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-91" value="drives live form, conditional rules, validation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dom-82" target="dom-87"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-92" value="record.session.completed → rollups" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=default;" edge="1" parent="1" source="dom-87" target="dom-88"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="dom-93" value="&lt;b&gt;Same model for every profile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Every activity can be recorded at entry level: ball, set, lap, shot, food item&lt;br&gt;• Parameters are typed (INT, DECIMAL, BOOL, ENUM, TEXT, DURATION) with optional &lt;i&gt;condition&lt;/i&gt; (shown/required when another value matches)&lt;br&gt;• Metrics are data: RATIO or SINGLE built from COUNT / COUNT_TRUE / SUM with optional filters → any ratio chart without code&lt;br&gt;• New sport / exercise / metric = catalog rows; templates versioned; sessions pin schema_version so history never breaks" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="940" width="740" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="sqa" name="05 Sequence – Sign-up, Login &amp; Subscription"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1720" pageHeight="1300" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="sqa-1" value="Sequence – Sign-up / Login (OIDC + PKCE) and Paid Subscription" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1640" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-2" value="Tokens are short-lived JWTs validated at the gateway; plan entitlements flow back into the token as a claim" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="54" width="1640" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-3" value="Member" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=36;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=50;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100.0" y="100" width="40" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-4" value="Mobile / Web App" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="245" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-5" value="Keycloak (IdP)" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-6" value="API Gateway (Kong)" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-7" value="user-profile-svc" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-8" value="subscription-svc" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1065" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-9" value="Payment Gateway" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-10" value="Event Bus" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;size=56;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1475" y="100" width="160" height="1160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-11" value="1. Sign up / Sign in" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="125.0" y="190" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="320.0" y="190" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-12" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;targetShapes=umlLifeline;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="320.0" y="220" width="10" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-13" value="2. GET /authorize (code_challenge, PKCE)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330.0" y="230" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="525.0" y="230" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-14" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;targetShapes=umlLifeline;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="236" width="10" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-15" value="3. Authenticate: password · Google/Apple · MFA" style="html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="535.0" y="266" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="535.0" y="292" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="565.0" y="266"/><mxPoint x="565.0" y="292"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-16" value="4. 302 redirect with auth code" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="525.0" y="316" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="330.0" y="316" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-17" value="5. POST /token (code + code_verifier)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330.0" y="352" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="525.0" y="352" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-18" value="6. access JWT (10 min) + rotating refresh token" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="525.0" y="388" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="330.0" y="388" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-19" value="7. PUT /api/v1/profiles/me  (Bearer JWT)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330.0" y="434" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="730.0" y="434" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-20" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;targetShapes=umlLifeline;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730.0" y="440" width="10" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-21" value="8. Verify JWT (cached JWKS) · rate limit · add X-Request-ID, traceparent" style="html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740.0" y="470" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="740.0" y="496" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="770.0" y="470"/><mxPoint x="770.0" y="496"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-22" value="9. forward request" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740.0" y="516" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="935.0" y="516" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-23" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;targetShapes=umlLifeline;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="935.0" y="522" width="10" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-24" value="10. Upsert profile (id = token sub) + outbox row (one tx)" style="html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="945.0" y="552" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="945.0" y="578" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="975.0" y="552"/><mxPoint x="975.0" y="578"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-25" value="11. user.registered (via outbox relay)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#7E57C2;fontColor=#5E35B1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="945.0" y="598" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1550.0" y="598" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-26" value="12. 201 Created – profile" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="935.0" y="628" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="330.0" y="628" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-27" value="13. POST /api/v1/subscriptions/checkout {plan: PRO}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330.0" y="718" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="730.0" y="718" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-28" value="14. forward (JWT claims)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740.0" y="752" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1140.0" y="752" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-29" value="" style="html=1;points=[];perimeter=orthogonalPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;targetShapes=umlLifeline;portConstraint=eastwest;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#4D4D4D;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140.0" y="756" width="10" height="310" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-30" value="15. create subscription / order" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1150.0" y="786" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1345.0" y="786" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-31" value="16. checkout URL / order id" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1345.0" y="820" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1150.0" y="820" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-32" value="17. 200 {checkoutUrl}" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1140.0" y="854" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="330.0" y="854" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-33" value="18. Pays on hosted checkout / in-app purchase" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="125.0" y="894" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1345.0" y="894" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-34" value="19. POST /webhooks/payments (signed)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1345.0" y="934" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="740.0" y="934" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-35" value="20. forward (webhook route, no JWT)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740.0" y="968" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1140.0" y="968" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-36" value="21. Verify signature · dedupe provider_event_id · ACTIVE · outbox" style="html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=4;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=middle;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1150.0" y="1002" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1150.0" y="1028" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1180.0" y="1002"/><mxPoint x="1180.0" y="1028"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-37" value="22. Admin API: set user attribute plan=PRO" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=block;endFill=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1140.0" y="1048" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="535.0" y="1048" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-38" value="23. subscription.activated" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=10;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#7E57C2;fontColor=#5E35B1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1150.0" y="1082" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1550.0" y="1082" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-39" value="alt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;pointerEvents=0;width=60;height=24;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#888888;swimlaneFillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="672" width="1530" height="454" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-40" value="[user chooses a paid plan]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="218" y="674" width="1450" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqa-41" value="Next token refresh carries &lt;b&gt;plan=PRO&lt;/b&gt; claim → gateway &amp;amp; services enforce entitlements (max trackers, custom parameters, history range) without a synchronous call." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="1142" width="600" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="sqr" name="06 Sequence – Live Session Recording"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1560" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="sqr-1" value="Sequence – Live Granular Session: log every ball offline, checkpoint every 3–5 min, submit on End" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sqr-2" value="Entries are durable on the device first; checkpoints upsert by client_entry_id (idempotent); analytics runs once the session is COMPLETED" style="text;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#55